  m_text: "\u2022 <b>Key Effect:</b> Trees regrow after cutting, showing nature\u2019s
    ability to renew forest cover over time..\r\n\u2022 <b>Example: </b>: Sustainable
    forestry ensures continuous timber supply without deforestation.\r\n"
